    <string name="recovery_code_what_for_body">Your GPS history and statistics are encrypted on this phone before they are uploaded. Nobody else can read them — not other users, not the server, not us.\n\nThe key comes from your password. If you forget your password, this code is the only way back to that data. Lose both and it is gone permanently: your account and everything else will still be fine, but those encrypted backups cannot be recovered by anyone.</string>
